  <prompt>
    Wire the grounding predicate (code half of FR-H1): add a new AgentToolFilterContext field for the host-context precondition, thread ChatHostContext from SprkChatAgentFactory, and add a new deterministic PreFilter branch that reads the grounding-predicate column (task 003). "Create matter" is hidden when already inside a matter — a pure predicate, no model call.
  </prompt>

  <role>
    Senior .NET developer expert in AgentToolProjection.PreFilter, SprkChatAgentFactory host-context threading, and ADR-039 grounding (pure predicate).
  </role>

  <goal>
    A new PreFilter branch removes capabilities whose grounding-predicate column precondition is not met, using a new AgentToolFilterContext field fed by ChatHostContext threaded from SprkChatAgentFactory. "Create matter" is hidden when already inside a matter. Covered by direct PreFilter-branch unit tests + tests/integration/seam/** (ADR-043 DoD). No model call; no hardcoded tool-name list.
  </goal>

  <context>
